	)
	(text_box "Note on DIO2: DIO2=1 during Tx and DIO2=0 in any other mode, this is a special mode set during configuration. This is tied to TXEN to switch the internal RF TX switch. Switching the RXEN is done by the MCU to save the need for an extra inverter IC between DIO2 and RXEN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 78.74 53.34 0)
		(size 54.61 13.97)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
